{curly} is preloaded and read-only. [square] is runtime, created only from what the caller actually says.



PRELOADED

{caller_number} — the number the call is coming from. She may use it instead of making the caller recite digits, but confirms rather than assumes, because people ring from a spouse's or neighbour's phone. Never proof of identity, never spoken unprompted.

